infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title CommonJS vs ESM — one root split: dynamic vs static
  compares
    - label CommonJS
      children
        - label Synchronous require()
          desc Blocks until the target file is fully evaluated
        - label Value-copy exports
          desc Destructured imports freeze at require time
        - label Dynamic resolution
          desc require() runs line by line at runtime
        - label No tree-shaking, no top-level await
          desc Runtime object shape; __dirname for free
    - label ESM
      children
        - label Async static graph
          desc Imports hoisted; resolved before any code runs
        - label Live read-only bindings
          desc Imports track the exporter's current value
        - label Static resolution
          desc Top-level only; whole graph known up front
        - label Tree-shaking + top-level await
          desc Static shape; paths from import.meta.url
theme
  palette #6366f1 #14b8a6
